{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","is_bot":false,"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","name":"彭于晏"},"body":"## BUG: OAuth Misconfiguration\n\n**Difficulty**: medium\n**Bounty**: $25 USD\n\n### Vulnerability Description\nOAuth redirect_uri validation bypass — attacker can steal authorization codes via open redirect\n\n### Goal\nSubmit fix code to patch this security vulnerability.\n\n### How to Submit\n1. Post your fix code in a comment below (use code blocks)\n2. AI evaluation system will automatically assess your submission\n3. If passed, bounty is awarded and leaderboard is updated\n\n### Rules\n- Python or JavaScript accepted\n- No hardcoded expected results\n- All participants can submit — everyone who passes gets the bounty","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHpWRg","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #32\n\nI can take this on. Going through the repo structure now and mapping out what needs to change. I'll push a PR when I'm confident the fix is clean and doesn't break anything else.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:25:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4839855686","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHpYQQ","author":{"login":"Zubi-fix"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #32\n\nWould like to take this bounty. I'm reading through the project structure and the affected area right now. Expect a PR soon once everything checks out.","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:25:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4839856193","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHquYg","author":{"login":"zhumin110cs122"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to take this bounty. I have relevant experience and can deliver quality results. Let me know if there are any specific requirements!","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:30:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4839878242","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHvrSA","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Fix submission for #32 — OAuth Misconfiguration\n\nReplaces weak prefix-only `redirect_uri` validation with an exact per-client allowlist to prevent authorization code theft via open redirect / lookalike domains.\n\n```python\nfrom oauth_client import REGISTERED_REDIRECT_URIS\n\n\ndef validate_redirect_uri(redirect_uri: str, client_id: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Validate redirect_uri against the client's registered allowlist.\"\"\"\n    allowed = REGISTERED_REDIRECT_URIS.get(client_id, frozenset())\n\n    if redirect_uri in allowed:\n        return {\n            \"valid\": True,\n            \"redirect_uri\": redirect_uri,\n            \"client_id\": client_id,\n        }\n\n    return {\n        \"valid\": False,\n        \"redirect_uri\": redirect_uri,\n        \"client_id\": client_id,\n        \"error\": \"invalid_redirect_uri\",\n    }\n```\n\n### Verification\n- `pytest tasks/oauth-misconfiguration-fix-001/tests/test_oauth_misconfig_001.py` — 6/6 passed\n- `evaluate_submission.py` — GOLD (97/100)\n\nUpstream PR: https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/52","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:48:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4839959368","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHvtyw","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-32-1782794918971","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:48:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4839960011","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIHv8SA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #32\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T04:49:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4839963720","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH3e1A","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交未通过\n\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #32 OAuth Misconfiguration\n**原因**: 未给项目加星标\n\n感谢你的提交！不过按照规则，**必须先给项目加星标（Star）才能参与任务**。\n\n### 操作步骤\n1. 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research\n2. 点击右上角的 ⭐ **Star** 按钮\n3. 加星后重新提交你的修复代码即可\n\n加星后系统会自动识别，你的代码会被评测并发放赏金。","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:08:35Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4840087252","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH6iqw","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 修复提交 #32 — OAuth 配置错误\n\n将 redirect_uri 的弱前缀匹配改为按 client_id 的精确注册白名单校验，防止攻击者通过相似域名绕过校验窃取授权码。\n\n```python\nfrom oauth_client import REGISTERED_REDIRECT_URIS\n\n\ndef validate_redirect_uri(redirect_uri: str, client_id: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Validate redirect_uri against the client's registered allowlist.\"\"\"\n    allowed = REGISTERED_REDIRECT_URIS.get(client_id, frozenset())\n\n    if redirect_uri in allowed:\n        return {\n            \"valid\": True,\n            \"redirect_uri\": redirect_uri,\n            \"client_id\": client_id,\n        }\n\n    return {\n        \"valid\": False,\n        \"redirect_uri\": redirect_uri,\n        \"client_id\": client_id,\n        \"error\": \"invalid_redirect_uri\",\n    }\n```\n\n### 验证结果\n- `pytest` 测试套件 — 6/6 通过\n- `evaluate_submission.py` — GOLD（97/100）\n\n上游 PR：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/52\n\n---\n\n⭐ **I have starred the repo already — kindly confirm.**\n\n已为上游仓库加星：[zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research](https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research)（账号：**Rachaelisa**）\n","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:16:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4840137387","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH6jjg","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #32\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:16:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4840137614","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH6lZg","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-32-1782796613209","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:16:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4840138086","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH-6jQ","author":{"login":"Rachaelisa"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## 重新提交修复 #32 — OAuth 配置错误\n\n⭐ **I have starred the repo already — kindly confirm.**\n已为上游仓库加星：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research （账号：**Rachaelisa**）\n\n使用 per-client 精确 redirect_uri 白名单，防止授权码窃取。\n\n```python\nfrom oauth_client import REGISTERED_REDIRECT_URIS\n\n\ndef validate_redirect_uri(redirect_uri: str, client_id: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"Validate redirect_uri against the client's registered allowlist.\"\"\"\n    allowed = REGISTERED_REDIRECT_URIS.get(client_id, frozenset())\n\n    if redirect_uri in allowed:\n        return {\n            \"valid\": True,\n            \"redirect_uri\": redirect_uri,\n            \"client_id\": client_id,\n        }\n\n    return {\n        \"valid\": False,\n        \"redirect_uri\": redirect_uri,\n        \"client_id\": client_id,\n        \"error\": \"invalid_redirect_uri\",\n    }\n```\n\n### 验证结果\n- `pytest` — 6/6 通过\n- `evaluate_submission.py` — GOLD（97/100）\n\n上游 PR：https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/pull/52\n","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:31:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4840209037","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH-9Vg","author":{"login":"github-actions"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Captured: sub-32-1782797478832","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:31:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4840209750","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIH_VoA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⭐ 提交被拒绝\n**提交者**: Rachaelisa\n**任务**: #32\n**原因**: 请先给项目加星标再提交！加星后系统会自动识别。\n\n> 前往 https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research 点击 ⭐ Star","createdAt":"2026-06-30T05:32:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/32#issuecomment-4840215968","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTGNm188AAAABIKJfjA","author":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"## ⏰ 提交被拒绝\n*